BFF Primordial Soup
Copyright 2026 Alexander Baker

This project reimplements the BFF ("bff_noheads") language and soup dynamics from
cubff (https://github.com/paradigms-of-intelligence/cubff), Copyright Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The evolved programs embedded in index.html (constant EVOLVED) were sampled from a
soup produced by running cubff.

Reference: B. Agüera y Arcas et al., "Computational Life: How Well-formed,
Self-replicating Programs Emerge from Simple Interaction", arXiv:2406.19108 (2024).
